   "text": "KEDGE Business School- Paris - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nKEDGE Business School- Paris\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nKEDGE Business School is the largest Business School in France and was established in 2013 by the merger of two renowned French Business Schools: BEM (Bordeaux Management School) and EUROMED Management. It is triple accredited by Equis, AMBA and AACSB and ranks among the best business schools in Europe. KEDGE is committed to sustainable development, CSR and inclusivity across its four main campuses in France, all of which are modern and equipped with state-of-the-art equipment. Research professors collaborate across five Centres of Excellence and four Centres of Expertise, promoting research through innovative teaching and learning that underpin a portfolio of 38 management and design programmes.KEDGE believes an international element is essential to students' future careers and with an established network of around 280 university partnerships, offers a wide range of opportunities for exchange programmes and double degrees with internationalism at the heart of its teaching methods, programmes and campuses.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n27/03/2026 06:36\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n27/03/2026 06:36\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nFrance\nYearly Fees\nMax: €21,120.00\nMin: €20,580.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n23%\n3,404 of 14,800 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nOn Campus\nFounded Year\n2013\nCampus(es)\nParis\nCountry\nFrance\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n29/03/2022\nContract End Date\n01/01/2036\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nhttps://student.kedge.edu/student-services/prepare-my-studies-abroad/student-accommodation-in-france/student-accommodation-paris\nScholarship Offered\nhttps://student.kedge.edu/student-services/prepare-my-studies-abroad/scholarships-in-france\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8jFnr7OOCLI\nInternship Details\nhttps://student.kedge.edu/student-services/professional-and-personal-development/internships\nAdditional Information\n-",
